  title="88% of Companies Already Had an AI Agent Incident — 7 Numbers That Explain the Crisis"
  description="Gartner says 40% of enterprise apps will integrate AI agents by end of 2026. 88% already had a security incident. We spend 17x more on 'AI-powered security' than on 'securing AI itself.' Only 6% have a mature strategy. By 2028, AI code defects will spike 2,500%. These aren't predictions. They're happening now."
